@startuml
title Data Usage - First Reservation

participant "SmartPhone" as Phone #purple
participant "NetworkFunction" as NF #lightblue
participant "CCS_ChargingFunction" as CCF #lightblue

box "ServiceBalanceManagement"
  participant "CCS_AccountBalanceMgmt" as ABMF #blue
  participant "CCS_RatingFunction" as RF #blue
end box

box "ServiceUsageManagement"
  participant "CCS_ChargingDataFunction" as CDF #blue
end box

Phone -> NF : 1 start data session
activate NF
NF -> CCF : 2 authorize data session
activate CCF

CCF -> CDF : 3 Open CDR
CDF --> CCF : 4 CDR Opened

CCF -> ABMF : 5 get applicable balances for service
activate ABMF
ABMF -> ABMF : 6 balances for service retrieved
ABMF --> CCF : 7
deactivate ABMF

CCF -> RF : 8 determine value of the session and pass in balances
activate RF
RF -> RF : 9 value determined based on\nparameters and service details
note right of RF : 1MB increment used as part\nof establishing the value
RF --> CCF : 10 value established
deactivate RF

CCF -> CCF : 11 determine reservation amount

CCF -> ABMF : 12 reserve balance
activate ABMF
ABMF -> ABMF : 13 balance reservation added
ABMF --> CCF : 14 balance reservation successful
deactivate ABMF

CCF --> NF : 15 authorize session
deactivate CCF
NF --> Phone : 16 data session started
deactivate NF
note left of Phone : User starts to consume data

@enduml
